Compton wavelength:
\lambda=\frac{\hbar c}{m_\phi}\,.
With \hbar c=197.3269804~\text{eV·nm} and m_\phi=1~\text{meV}=10^{-3}\,\text{eV},
\lambda=\frac{197.3269804~\text{eV·nm}}{10^{-3}\,\text{eV}}
